      "writtenOn": "2025-02-13T01:47:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "@jeongik@google.com could you share your formatting method?\n\nI don\u0027t care about the formatting much, but colleagues having different formatting setup sounds scary.\n\n\nJust FYI, I only use what `repo upload` is doing. Here\u0027s my script that wraps formatter around it.\n\n```\npushd $(git rev-parse --show-toplevel) \u003e /dev/null\n\n${ANDROID_BUILD_TOP}/tools/repohooks/tools/google-java-format.py --fix \\\n  --google-java-format ${ANDROID_BUILD_TOP}/prebuilts/tools/common/google-java-format/google-java-format \\\n  --google-java-format-diff ${ANDROID_BUILD_TOP}/prebuilts/tools/common/google-java-format/google-java-format-diff.py\n\ngit show --name-only --format\u003d\"\" | grep -e \u0027kt$\u0027 | xargs -I{} ${ANDROID_BUILD_TOP}/external/ktfmt/ktfmt.sh --kotlinlang-style {} \\;\n\npopd \u003e /dev/null\n```",
      "parentUuid": "3267e66a_df81b4fa",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 124,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 124,
        "endChar": 45
      },
